    "confidence": "high",
    "notes": "Every component is the net token movement of the exploit contract 0xcd337b920678cf35143322ab31ab8977c3463a45 in the single exploit transaction, plus its native BNB balance, which goes from 0 at block 17634662 to 1224.650634144094162737 at block 17634663. Attacker-side inputs are excluded: 100 FTS and 3.02030953619907 MAHA were paid in, and the 5,000 fFTS and 2,000,000,000 ARTH.usd received are protocol receipt tokens with no external market. DefiLlama observations lie within 65 seconds of the incident timestamp; the four stablecoins use par, whose largest deviation from the DefiLlama observation is 0.25 percent. Contemporary reporting put the loss near USD 3 million, which is above this exact onchain sum; the difference is valuation method, not additional transfers."
